# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# This project is edited from both Windows and Linux. Without this, a Windows
# editor rewrites whole files to CRLF and every line shows as changed, burying
# real work in thousands of lines of whitespace-only diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pbf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
